<title>PAKISTAN: BANKS, FOREX MARKET IN PAKISTAN SHUT FOR HOLIDAY.</title>
<headline>BANKS, FOREX MARKET IN PAKISTAN SHUT FOR HOLIDAY.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State (central) Bank of Pakistan, commercial banks and foreign exchange markets were closed on Thursday for Pakistan's 50th anniversary of independence. They will reopen on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom (9221) 5685192; Fax (9221) 5673428</p>
